[SPEAKER_01]: That's how you kind of develop these perceptions by recognizing them for what they are.

14
00:01:53,957 --> 00:02:02,303
[SPEAKER_01]: But you will not be able to recognize the phenomenon of dispassion, unless everything else that's been leading to dispassion has been developed beforehand.

15
