[SPEAKER_01]: is to fully see the danger of sensuality, contemplate the danger, contemplate the peril of the trap, and all the hunter similes, and everything else, until you, like, absolutely mind becomes incapable of activating towards that type of pleasure, because of the fear of the danger.

61
