87
00:09:15,604 --> 00:09:17,525
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, because that animal is now tamed.

88
00:09:17,565 --> 00:09:19,006
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, it's subtler.

89
00:09:19,946 --> 00:09:20,426
[SPEAKER_01]: It's subtler.

90
00:09:20,686 --> 00:09:27,488
[SPEAKER_01]: It's higher, but it's more refined, that pleasure of taming the animal.

91
