[SPEAKER_00]: You want to always see the value of peace, regardless of the contrast or the absence of it.

102
00:10:11,573 --> 00:10:25,460
[SPEAKER_00]: Okay, but so, even if someone's been doing that for a long time, taming that animal, let the animals tame, and they're not doing anything unwholesome, and they haven't been wild for one year, two years,

