[SPEAKER_01]: Yes, yes, but they still might be attracted to centrality.

105
00:10:34,928 --> 00:10:35,048
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

106
00:10:35,248 --> 00:10:49,437
[SPEAKER_01]: So, if their environment would change, or become more challenging, or something, I don't know, the mind might revert back to, you know, the pleasure, in that it has not fully seen the drawbacks of, and the danger in, the pleasure of centrality.

