113
00:11:25,418 --> 00:11:45,929
[SPEAKER_01]: And you develop it, like that mind, that withstanding, by contemplating the danger of that prospect, and enduring the danger of the prospect, enduring the pull and the pain of saying no to it, and not acting out of it, and then contemplating the danger, and when the danger is absent, think like valuing the peace and the absence of danger.

114
00:11:46,309 --> 00:11:47,149
[SPEAKER_01]: Valuing that escape.

115
